<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45489" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐχετάομαι</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔχομαι</span>, only in
			pres. and impf. (without
			augm.):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pray</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοῖσι . . μεγάλ᾽ εὐχετόωντο ἕκαστος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					8.347
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				15.369
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κρονίωνι . . εὐχετάασθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					6.268
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντες δ᾽ εὐχετόωντο θεῶν Δῒ
					Νέστορί τ᾽ ἀνδρῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.761
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				8.467
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>boast, profess</i>, c. inf., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίνες ἔμμεναι εὐχετόωντο</span>; <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				1.172
			</span></i>, etc.; with inf. omitted, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.189
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>A.</u>
				289
			</span></i>; <i>brag</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵνα μή τις . . εὐχετόῳτ᾽ ἐπέεσσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					12.391
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ μὲν καλὸν ὑπέρβιον εὐχετάασθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					17.19
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὰψ αὔτως εὐχετάασθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					20.348
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κταμένοισιν ἐπ᾽ ἀνδράσιν
				εὐχετάασθαι</span>
			<i>to glory</i> over them, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				22.412
			</span></i>.</div>
